## BEHIND THE RECORD

![Recording Studio](https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1598488035139-bdbb2231ce04?w=1200)

### "We weren't trying to make a perfect record."

We recorded most of these songs after midnight.

Some were finished in a single take. Others took months to find their shape.

There are mistakes on this album. Breaths between verses. Guitar strings buzzing. The sound of a room that wasn't quite silent.

We left them in.

Because that's what it sounded like when we were there.

**— THE ARTIST**

